id: pmc-s2bk
title: "changelog:check verified in prepend mode against a replace-mode CHANGELOG, making the gate unsatisfiable"
description: "The changelog:check script ran the prepend-mode generator with --check, but CHANGELOG.md is generated by changelog:full in replace mode. The two modes render the same items differently, so the check reported the file out of date and no regeneration could ever satisfy it. In this repository the difference surfaced purely as entry ordering; the modes also differ in selection, which is what the fleet sweep surfaced elsewhere."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: changelog,ci,gate
created_at: "2026-08-09T20:00:52.133Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T20:24:47.935Z"
deadline: "2026-08-10T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T20:01:20.729Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T20:01:20.729Z"
author: claude
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "npm run changelog:check passes against the committed CHANGELOG.md, and the script verifies the same mode that generates the file"
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "npm run changelog:check exits 0 against the committed CHANGELOG.md"
actual_result: "npm run changelog:check reports the changelog is up to date and exits 0"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pmc-o58h,related,"2026-08-09T20:00:52.133Z",claude,"cli:create:dep",asserted
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:00:52.133Z",claude,"Root cause is a mode mismatch between generation and verification,not a bad changelog"
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:00:52.133Z",claude,"Fleet sweep found the same mismatch in pm-context,pm-csv,pm-github and pm-linear"
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:00:52.133Z",claude,"A verification command must run the same renderer mode that produced the artifact it verifies,otherwise the gate is structurally unsatisfiable rather than merely failing"
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  package.json,project,"changelog:check script aligned to replace mode"
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "npm run changelog:check",project,120
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  CHANGELOG.md,project,the file the gate verifies
close_reason: "Aligned changelog:check to the replace-mode generator so the gate verifies the same rendering that produces CHANGELOG.md"
body: "CI step 'Verify generated changelog is current' failed on both Node 22 and 26 for PR 135. Reproduced locally: prepend-mode check renders the six Fixed entries in completion-descending order while the committed replace-mode file hoists the two items carrying an explicit release field. Same entries, different order, so the diff never closes."
